c: 216 blueprint nodes, 97 Lean declarations, 164 edges.\\n- Open: the analytic complex-Lie uniformization witness and approved blueprint lean linkage remain open; declarations are intentionally unattached. Task remains running.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"warnings\": [\n    \"Task queue has 20 open tasks (recommended maximum 12) \\u2014 review whether some objectives are done, blocked, cancelled, duplicated, or better kept only as roadmap milestones.\"\n  ]\n}\n\n---\n[HORIZON] ◈ REQUIRED · 3 active protections: I-0074 \"**FGA picSharp rewire \nLANDED (run 0008): rout...\"; I-2034 \" FS blueprints frozen except corr...\"; \nI-2035 \" FS cross-project read, single-pr...\" — consult before editing: `horizon\ninbox list --mine --status open --kind protection --json`\n[HORIZON] ◈ Advisory · 16 unread inbox items: I-2092 \"Roadmap status mismatch: \nAJCR universal desce...\"; I-1662 \"REPLACING A HAND-ROLLED HYPOTHESIS BY 'THE \nST...\"; I-1894 \"Degree-zero pic0TypeFunctor is not yet Kleima...\"; +13 more — \nreview when relevant: `horizon inbox list --mine --unread --json`\n[HORIZON] ◈ session running 4m04s, 11.9k tokens out\n[HORIZON] ◈ Running sessions: run 0163 · task ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign; \nrun 0179 · task fs-milne; run 0181 · task fs-hartshorne; run 0182 · task \nfs-stacks-part01-prelim — message a team with `horizon inbox dm \ntask:ajcr-finite-stage-api-redesign --body \"Title\\n\\nMessage\"`; details: \n`horizon ps`\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"5b802ed9b979\",\n    \"title\": \"Base-change criterion\",\n    \"type\": \"tex\",\n    \"kind\": \"corollary\",\n    \"lean_status\": \"empty\",\n    \"state\": \"ready\",\n    \"direct_uses\": 0,\n    \"unlocks\": 38\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"d77dcd807be7\",\n    \"title\": \"Serre--Lang\",\n    \"type\": \"tex\",\n    \"kind\": \"theorem\",\n    \"lean_status\": \"empty\",\n    \"state\": \"ready\",\n    \"direct_uses\": 0,\n    \"unlocks\": 28\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"06c2c20d7e36\",\n    \"title\": \"Theorem of the cub